<Layout title="Just Free Software">
    <h1>Welcome</h1>

    <p>
        We are Just Free Software, an MA-based non-profit dedicated to
        publishing free and open source software.
    </p>

    <p>
        These are our current projects:
        <ul>
            <li>
                <a href="/just-block/info">Just Block</a>: A website blocker for
                Android that uses DNS filtering over QUIC. Written in Kotlin and
                Rust.
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="/just-capture/info">Just Capture</a>: A video recording
                app for iPhone and Android that backs up clips to your Google
                Drive as you record and can email the people you choose. Written
                in Swift and Kotlin.
            </li>
            <li>placeholder</li>
        </ul>
    </p>

    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p>
        You can reach us via email at:{" "}
        <a href="mailto:justfreesoftwarema@gmail.com">
            justfreesoftwarema@gmail.com
        </a>
    </p>
</Layout>
